---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Closing from '../components/Closing.astro';
import Arrow from '../components/Arrow.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import owner from '../assets/blake-bannon.png';
---
<Layout title="About Blake & Fenrir | Fenrir Commercial Cleaning Service" description="Meet Blake Bannon, owner of Fenrir Commercial Cleaning Service in Bailey, Colorado. Direct communication and a clear plan for local workplaces.">
  <section class="page-intro container"><p class="eyebrow">Owner-operated. Based in Bailey.</p><h1>Local work.<br/><em>Personal attention.</em></h1><p class="intro-lead">Care for a workplace begins with understanding the people who use it.</p></section>
  <section class="about-story container">
    <figure class="owner-figure"><Image src={owner} alt="Blake Bannon, owner of Fenrir Commercial Cleaning Service." widths={[384, 576, 766]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width: 1392px) 45vw, 590px" width={766} height={766} format="webp"/><figcaption>Blake Bannon · Owner, Fenrir Commercial Cleaning Service</figcaption></figure>
    <div class="story-copy">
      <h2>Hey there!</h2>
      <p>My name is Blake Bannon. I was born and raised in Conifer and grew up in our beautiful mountain community.</p>
      <p>After around 5 years of living in different parts of the state (and traveling to 40+ states around our nation while in various sales roles) I decided I didn't want to live anywhere else.</p>
      <p>Community has always been important to me, and taking pride in my work has always been foundational to how I live my life, all the way back to when I started my own business serving the Conifer area when I was 13.</p>
      <p>If you're looking for a commercial cleaning service, give me a call. I'd love the opportunity to connect with you, learn more about what you're looking for, and see if I can be of service.</p>
      <div class="owner-signature">
        <p>Respectfully,</p>
        <span>Blake Bannon</span>
        <a class="owner-profile" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/blake-bannon/" aria-label="Blake Bannon on LinkedIn">https://www.linkedin.com/in/blake-bannon/</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section about-expectations container"><p class="eyebrow">What you can expect</p><h2>Simple commitments.<br/>Careful follow-through.</h2><div class="about-values"><article><span class="index-number">01</span><h3>A shared understanding.</h3><p>We agree on the rooms, tasks, frequency, and access arrangements before cleaning begins.</p></article><article><span class="index-number">02</span><h3>A clear proposal.</h3><p>Your written cleaning proposal reflects your space and scope. Initial resets or specialist needs are discussed separately.</p></article><article><span class="index-number">03</span><h3>An open conversation.</h3><p>You have a direct point of contact for questions, adjustments, and the everyday details that matter in your building.</p></article></div><a class="text-link" href="/#included">Explore what’s included <Arrow/></a></section>
  <Closing/>
</Layout>

<style>
  .owner-profile { display: block; max-width: 100%; min-height: 44px; margin-top: 8px; font-size: 16px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
</style>
